Usage: rustty +<action> [flags]

This is the Rustty helper CLI that accompanies the graphical Rustty app.
To launch the terminal directly, please launch the graphical app
(i.e. Rustty.app on macOS). This CLI can be used to perform various
actions such as inspecting the version, listing fonts, etc.

On macOS, the terminal can also be launched using `open -na Rustty.app`,
or `open -na Rustty.app --args --foo=bar --baz=qux` to pass arguments.

